视觉一致性适配。\n\n\n备注：ERNIE-Image-Turbo 模型在8步生图时，人物皮肤质感与纹理显得过火，改回4步生图时会有所改善，后续通过z-image turbo的二次采用（并改用euler ancestral\n\n采样器与UltraFlux-v1vae模型可以改善皮肤质感与增强画面锐度。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [532.2838745117188, 332.9770202636719], "pos": [412.89306640625, 3763.4814453125], "id": 98, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["官方指导ERNIE-Image-Turbo 使用8步生图，但模型在8步生图时，人物皮肤质感与纹理显得过于明显，若生成的是人物面部特写可以尝试4步生图，皮肤质感会有所改善（但有可能出现双头或多手等畸形情况，可以通过抽卡改善）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [298.4576416015625, 149.51466369628906], "pos": [1640.3082275390625, 3007.886962890625], "id": 97, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [95], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#332922", "widgets_values": ["ernie-image-turbo.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "UNET名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "剪枝类型"}], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [264.6437683105469, 85.89704132080078], "pos": [1011.29150390625, 2506.327880859375], "id": 80, "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"name": "ernie-image.safetensors", "directory": "diffusion_models", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ERNIE-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ernie-image.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.3.73", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 10}, {"out